{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IPerceptionManager/IPerceptionManager_ObstacleData.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>ObstacleData</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"title class_\">ObstacleData</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><a href=\"IPerceptionManager.html\">IPerceptionManager</a><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">ObstacleData</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.1.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">ObstacleData</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">感知数据，包括障碍物测距数据。</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data\" aria-label=\"复制包名\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"描述：\" style=\"display: none;\">描述：</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">感知数据，包括障碍物测距数据。<br>\n<br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.1.0开始支持</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>成员</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">4</span> 个成员</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"按名称、参数或描述筛选\" aria-label=\"筛选成员\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">方法</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>方法</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">4</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"gethorizontalangleinterval 获取水平障碍物测距数据角度间隔，水平方向上以360度围绕飞行器的一个角度间隔。比如： 如果该值为1，则表示gethorizontalobstacledistance获取到的水平障碍物测距数据有360个数据（360/1）。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取水平障碍物测距数据角度间隔，水平方向上以360度围绕飞行器的一个角度间隔。比如： 如果该值为1，则表示getHorizontalObstacleDistance获取到的水平障碍物测距数据有360个数据（360/1）。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"gethorizontalobstacledistance 获取水平障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。可通过gethorizontalangleinterval获取水平障碍物测距数据的角度间隔。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取水平障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。可通过getHorizontalAngleInterval获取水平障碍物测距数据的角度间隔。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getupwardobstacledistance 获取上视障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。表示飞行器距离上视障碍物的距离。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getUpwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取上视障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。表示飞行器距离上视障碍物的距离。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getdownwardobstacledistance 获取下视障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。表示飞行器距离下视障碍物的距离。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getDownwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取下视障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。表示飞行器距离下视障碍物的距离。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<h4 id=\"Members\">Members</h4>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval_inline\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getHorizontalAngleInterval</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取水平障碍物测距数据角度间隔，水平方向上以360度围绕飞行器的一个角度间隔。比如： 如果该值为1，则表示<code><a href=\"IPerceptionManager_ObstacleData.html#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</a></code>获取到的水平障碍物测距数据有360个数据（360/1）。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span></code></span></td><td>返回水平障碍物测距数据角度间隔。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance_inline\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalobstacledistance_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getHorizontalObstacleDistance</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getHorizontalObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取水平障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。可通过<code><a href=\"IPerceptionManager_ObstacleData.html#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_gethorizontalangleinterval\">getHorizontalAngleInterval</a></code>获取水平障碍物测距数据的角度间隔。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span></code></span></td><td>返回水平障碍物测距数据。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance_inline\">getUpwardObstacleDistance</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getupwardobstacledistance_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getUpwardObstacleDistance</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getUpwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取上视障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。表示飞行器距离上视障碍物的距离。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span></code></span></td><td>返回上视障碍物测距数据。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance_inline\">getDownwardObstacleDistance</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iperceptionmanager_obstacledata_getdownwardobstacledistance_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getDownwardObstacleDistance</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getDownwardObstacleDistance</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.aircraft.perception.data</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取下视障碍物测距数据，单位：毫米。表示飞行器距离下视障碍物的距离。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span></code></span></td><td>返回下视障碍物测距数据。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font c